                       </h1>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-[#737780]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"current date text\" data-reason=\"text content updated by script to reflect the current date\">\n                                Tuesday, 27 Aug\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-3 w-px bg-[#2B2E34]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"ledger-tabular text-[#A5A8AD]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-3\">\n                                31 attempts · 79% average\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"ledger-action-grid grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_190px] gap-7 rounded-[12px] border border-[#2B2E34] bg-[#17191D] p-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#B98638]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                Next practice\n                            </p>\n                            <h2 class=\"mt-3 text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#F2F1EC]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-2\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Grotesk', Manrope, sans-serif;\">\n                                Practice Hindi\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#A5A8AD]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-3\">\n                                Last result:\n                                <span class=\"ledger-tabular text-[#F2F1EC]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-3-1\">\n                                    52%\n                                </span>\n                                · 1 attempt\n                          