                                 </strong>\n                                    days to exam\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-start sm:justify-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-2 rounded-[8px] bg-[#B98638] px-4 text-sm font-bold text-[#101114] transition-colors duration-100 hover:bg-[#D09D50] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#B98638]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                Start practice\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right ledger-icon-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 grid ledger-metric-rail grid-cols-4 divide-x divide-[#2B2E34] border-y border-[#2B2E34] py-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3\">\n                        <div class=\"px-4 first:pl-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-1\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-[#737780]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                Attempts\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"ledger-tabular mt-2 text-[25px] font-semibold text-[#F2F1EC]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                31\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"px-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-[#737780]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2-1\">\n                                Average accuracy\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"ledger-tabular mt-2 text-[25px] font-semibold text-[#F2F1EC]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2\">\n     